 "claim": "For each k = 2..20, the joint cover CNF for heptiamonds M and X on the stated board is unsatisfiable (CaDiCaL 3.0.1; DRAT proof checked by drat-trim): no figure of area 7k inside that board can be tiled both by k copies of M and by k copies of X. Bounded result only.",
 "coordinates": "package cells (r,c): rows of triangles; (r+c) even has edge neighbours (r,c-1),(r,c+1),(r-1,c); (r+c) odd has (r,c-1),(r,c+1),(r+1,c). Board for k = all (r,c) with 0<=r<board_rows, 0<=c<board_cols; board_rows = max(6, ceil(2*sqrt(7k))) + 2, board_cols = board_rows + 2.",
